    <!-- Privacy Policy Dialog -->
    <string name="privacy_policy_title">Privacy Policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">ShelfLife is built local-first. All your pantry items, expiration dates, custom notes, and waste-prevention statistics are stored securely and exclusively on your local device using Android Room Database.\n\nCamera permission is used strictly for real-time barcode detection on your device. Video frames are never recorded, saved, or uploaded.\n\nPublic barcode queries to OpenFoodFacts and recipe matching via TheMealDB contain zero personal identifiable information.\n\nContact: support@shelflife.app</string>
